# /south — Privacy Policy

**Last Updated:** November 10, 2026

## 1. Introduction
Welcome to /south. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information when using our Discord bot and services.

## 2. Information We Collect
Depending on how the bot is configured, we may collect:
- Discord User IDs
- Discord Server IDs
- Usernames and server information
- Information necessary for bot commands and moderation features

We do not intentionally collect sensitive personal information.

## 3. How We Use Information
Information may be used to:
- Provide bot features and commands
- Manage server-related functions
- Improve bot performance
- Prevent abuse and unauthorized use

## 4. Data Sharing
We do not sell or rent personal information. Information is not shared with third parties except when necessary to operate the service or comply with legal requirements.

## 5. Data Storage and Security
We take reasonable steps to protect information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure.

## 6. Data Removal
Users may request the deletion of information associated with their Discord account by contacting the bot owner.

## 7. Third-Party Services
Our bot operates through Discord. Your use of Discord is also subject to Discord's own Privacy Policy.

## 8. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy when necessary. Updates will be posted on this page.

## 9. Contact
For privacy questions or data deletion requests, contact:

**Discord:** Contact the /south staff team through our official Discord server.

